ハニーに変身完了して「そんな…ハニーヴァージナルインビテイション！が効かない！」「負ける…キューティーハニーなのに負ける！」等と言いながらオナニーを続けている。\n　「イクッ、イっちゃぅ！」と喘ぎ声を上げて絶頂する。\n\nページ割りなどはお任せいたします。\n台詞以外にちょっとした喘ぎ声を入れて頂けると嬉しいです。\nご検討のほど宜しくお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@strangepop/works/615", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2532a3b6/uploads/origins/1688ab4c-aebc-46ce-9004-bc176e8d43ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d6065d262f0a85bb52f9aa1f95507c6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2532a3b6/uploads/origins/1688ab4c-aebc-46ce-9004-bc176e8d43ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d6065d262f0a85bb52f9aa1f95507c6, https://si.imgix.net/2532a3b6/uploads/origins/1688ab4c-aebc-46ce-9004-bc176e8d43ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05b6b26eff0a4bdf06c71718aa6e1709 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2532a3b6/uploads/origins/1688ab4c-aebc-46ce-9004-bc176e8d43ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7fa35ae1ddec74698fe98ceb752c5b8 3x", "genre": "comic", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello sensei! I'm back and I want to continue the comic between shinobi girl 古手川唯 and the Demon Lord 結城リト. \n\nNow that 唯ちゃん is wet enough, リト decides to tie her up in a suggestive pose. You can just draw a hand here if you want, of リトpulling the strings with one finger. \n\nThe  speech bubble should read \"Well then, let's get you into a more suggestive pose\"\n\nAnother panel could be of 唯ちゃん's leg being lifted into position, like this: https://www.deviantart.com/stash/02dwgo609myn\n\nFor this request I want the main panel to be リトand 唯ちゃん in this pose: https://www.deviantart.com/stash/0guvo42jke2\n\nThe speech bubbles for the main panel should read as 唯ちゃん begging \"Please, no!\" and リトresponding \"Your mouth says \"no\" but your lips say \"yes\"!\n\nIf three panels are too  much, just prioritize the main panel (https://www.deviantart.com/stash/0guvo42jke2) and this one (https://www.deviantart.com/stash/02dwgo609myn)\n\nPlease add a version without speech bubbles. 唯ちゃん is still wearing fishnets stockings.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@strangepop/works/614", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c6b6b30/uploads/origins/cff3973c-c343-4c03-beef-9782ec600711?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b25a65c796b73aaa77af89365c31bac", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6c6b6b30/uploads/origins/cff3973c-c343-4c03-beef-9782ec600711?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b25a65c796b73aaa77af89365c31bac, https://si.imgix.net/6c6b6b30/uploads/origins/cff3973c-c343-4c03-beef-9782ec600711?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a0db84fa5cecb9806155ad64d43064d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6c6b6b30/uploads/origins/cff3973c-c343-4c03-beef-9782ec600711?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf5fa6473f343b664cc9ddc5830ff067 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "沖黒/OKI KURO様、お初に依頼を致します。\n単刀直入に申し上げますと、\nFALFANARTの制作をお願いしたく、筆を取っている次第です。\nさて、F.A.L氏の(配信アバター)代理さんに、\nゼルダの伝説の主人公キャラ「リンク」のコスプレをさせた\nトリビュートアートを一筆お願いしたいのです。\n要目は一枚絵で差分は不要です。\n構図などはお任せします。\n\n以上です。\n参考資料\nURL先間接参照の2点のみ\nhttps://w.atwiki.jp/nitendo/pages/4086.html\n>>「リンク」の資料\n\nhttps://dic.pixiv.net/a/%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E3%81%95%E3%82%93(F.A.L)\n>>(F.A.L様の)代理さん\n\nhttps://w.atwiki.jp/nitendo/pages/4086.html__https://dic.pixiv.net/a/%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E3%81%95%E3%82%93(F.A.L)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@strangepop/works/613", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d42bf673/uploads/origins/3b8ea627-0fd3-4581-a7d9-8a881c3199eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0545842827bfe5b0f6da6a12b05df2b8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d42bf673/uploads/origins/3b8ea6